		(property "Description" "A PCIe x1 to 4-port SATA bridge controller, ASM1064 class, in a 48-pin QFN with an exposed pad. See the note at the top of this file about the symbol."
			(at 203.2 355.6 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "aipcb.reason" "The bridge. Its south side faces the card edge so the PCIe lane runs straight down to the fingers; ports 2 and 3 leave to the west and ports 0 and 1 to the east, in the order their connectors sit in, so no SATA pair has to cross another."
			(at 203.2 355.6 0)
